      <title>奥尔特曼直言仅治愈癌症还不够 AI需证明能赋予人更多自主权</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260904/%E5%A5%A5%E5%B0%94%E7%89%B9%E6%9B%BC%E7%9B%B4%E8%A8%80%E4%BB%85%E6%B2%BB%E6%84%88%E7%99%8C%E7%97%87%E8%BF%98%E4%B8%8D%E5%A4%9F-AI%E9%9C%80%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E8%83%BD%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%88%E4%BA%BA%E6%9B%B4%E5%A4%9A%E8%87%AA%E4%B8%BB%E6%9D%83/</link>
